{%- comment -%} ── FAQ ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="klm-faq" id="klm-faq">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="klm-section__heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="klm-faq__list">
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What type of mattress is the Klawford Duo Sleep?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">The Klawford Duo Sleep is a 31 cm premium foam mattress featuring a 25 cm orthopaedic foam core, three layers of medium-firm comfort foam, and a premium bamboo knitted cover. It is designed to deliver balanced comfort and elevated luxury — supportive enough for back sleepers, plush enough for side and combination sleepers.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What is the orthopaedic foam core?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">The 25 cm orthopaedic foam core forms the foundation of the Duo Sleep. It is a high-density foam engineered to keep your spine in proper alignment while you sleep, distributing your body weight evenly and reducing pressure on your hips and lower back. The extra reinforcement throughout the core helps the mattress maintain its shape and support long term.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What are the triple comfort foam layers?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">Above the orthopaedic core, the Duo Sleep has three layers of medium-firm foam that work together to cushion pressure points at the shoulders, hips, and lower back. The layers are calibrated to provide a plush, comfortable feel on the surface while maintaining the firm base support underneath — so you get the best of both worlds.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What is the bamboo knitted cover and what does it do?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">The Duo Sleep is wrapped in a premium bamboo knitted fabric cover. Bamboo fibres are naturally breathable and moisture-wicking, which means the cover actively draws warmth and moisture away from your body during sleep. This helps regulate your sleeping temperature — keeping you cool in warmer months and comfortable throughout the year.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What firmness level is the Duo Sleep?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">The Duo Sleep is a medium-firm mattress — it provides solid, spine-aligning support from the orthopaedic foam core while the comfort foam layers on top add a plush, cushioned feel. This balance makes it suitable for back sleepers, side sleepers, and combination sleepers who want support without a hard feel.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">Is the Duo Sleep suitable for couples?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">Yes — the Duo Sleep is specifically designed with couples in mind. The foam construction absorbs and minimises partner movement, which means disturbances on one side of the mattress are less likely to be felt on the other. It is listed as ideal for couples and combination sleepers on the product spec sheet.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">Do your products conform to UK fire safety regulations?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">Yes — all Klawford mattresses meet UK fire safety regulations under The Furniture and Furnishings (Fire Safety) Regulations 1988 (amended). You can sleep safely and confidently in every mattress we sell.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">What sizes is the Duo Sleep available in?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">The Klawford Duo Sleep is available in all standard UK sizes — Small Single (2ft 6), Single (3ft), Small Double (4ft), Double (4ft 6), King (5ft), and Super King (6ft). Select your preferred size using the size selector on the product page.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">Is delivery free on the Duo Sleep?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">Yes — free delivery is included with every Klawford Duo Sleep purchase. We deliver to the room of your choice with a 2-man team, so you do not need to manage heavy packaging alone. You can select your preferred delivery date at checkout. The mattress also comes with a 60-night risk-free trial — if it is not right for you, contact us and we will arrange a return and full refund.</div>
      </details>
      <details class="klm-faq__item">
        <summary class="klm-faq__q">Can I spread the cost of the Duo Sleep?</summary>
        <div class="klm-faq__a">Yes — we offer 0% interest-free financing through DivideBuy, letting you spread the cost over up to 12 months at no extra charge. Klarna is also available at checkout for pay-later or 3-payment options. Select your preferred payment method when you proceed to checkout.</div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
(function(){
  var variants = {{ product.variants | json }};

  function updateSizePriceDiffs(selectedPrice) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.klm-size-btn').forEach(function(b) {
      var btnPrice = parseInt(b.dataset.price, 10);
      var priceEl  = b.querySelector('[data-role="price"]');
      if (!priceEl) return;
      if (b.classList.contains('is-active')) {
        priceEl.textContent = formatMoney(btnPrice);
        priceEl.className = 'klm-size-btn__price';
      } else {
        var diff = btnPrice - selectedPrice;
        if (diff < 0) {
          priceEl.textContent = '-' + formatMoney(Math.abs(diff));
          priceEl.className = 'klm-size-btn__price klm-size-btn__price--save';
        } else if (diff > 0) {
          priceEl.textContent = '+' + formatMoney(diff);
          priceEl.className = 'klm-size-btn__price';
        } else {
          priceEl.textContent = formatMoney(btnPrice);
          priceEl.className = 'klm-size-btn__price';
        }
      }
    });
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.klm-size-btn').forEach(function(btn){
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.querySelectorAll('.klm-size-btn').forEach(function(b){
        b.classList.remove('is-active');
        b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'false');
      });
      btn.classList.add('is-active');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-pressed', 'true');

      var vid     = btn.dataset.vid;
      var price   = parseInt(btn.dataset.price, 10);
      var compare = parseInt(btn.dataset.compare, 10);
      var name    = btn.dataset.size;

      var nameEl = document.getElementById('klm-size-name');
      if (nameEl) nameEl.textContent = name;

      var dimsEl = document.getElementById('klm-size-dims');
      if (dimsEl) {
        var dw = btn.dataset.width;
        var dl = btn.dataset.length;
        if (dw && dl) {
          dimsEl.innerHTML = '<span>Width: ' + dw + 'cm</span><span>Length: ' + dl + 'cm</span>';
          dimsEl.style.display = '';
        } else {
          dimsEl.style.display = 'none';
        }
      }

      var priceEl   = document.getElementById('klm-price');
      var compareEl = document.getElementById('klm-compare');
      var pctEl     = document.getElementById('klm-pct');
      if (priceEl) priceEl.textContent = formatMoney(price);
      if (compareEl && pctEl) {
        if (compare > price) {
          compareEl.textContent = formatMoney(compare);
          compareEl.style.display = '';
          var pct = Math.round((compare - price) / compare * 100);
          pctEl.textContent = pct + '% OFF';
          pctEl.style.display = '';
        } else {
          compareEl.style.display = 'none';
          pctEl.style.display = 'none';
        }
      }

      updateSizePriceDiffs(price);

      var inp = document.getElementById('klm-variant-id');
      if (inp) inp.value = vid;

      var atcBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.klm-atc');
      var variant = variants.find(function(v){ return String(v.id) === String(vid); });
      var avail = variant ? variant.available : true;
      atcBtns.forEach(function(b){ b.disabled = !avail; });
      var labelEl = document.getElementById('klm-atc-label');
      if (labelEl) labelEl.textContent = avail ? 'Add to Basket' : 'Sold Out';
    });
  });

  function formatMoney(cents){
    return '£' + (cents / 100).toFixed(2).replace(/\.00$/, '');
  }

  var thumbsEl = document.getElementById('klm-thumbs');
  var mainImg  = document.getElementById('klm-main-img');

  if (thumbsEl && mainImg) {
    thumbsEl.addEventListener('click', function(e){
      var thumb = e.target.closest('.klm-gallery__thumb');
      if (!thumb) return;
      mainImg.src = thumb.dataset.src;
      mainImg.removeAttribute('srcset');
      mainImg.removeAttribute('sizes');
      var iw = parseInt(thumb.dataset.width, 10);
      var ih = parseInt(thumb.dataset.height, 10);
      mainImg.style.objectFit = (ih > iw) ? 'contain' : 'cover';
      document.querySelectorAll('.klm-gallery__thumb').forEach(function(t){ t.classList.remove('is-active'); });
      thumb.classList.add('is-active');
    });
  }

  var prevBtn = document.getElementById('klm-thumb-prev');
  var nextBtn = document.getElementById('klm-thumb-next');
  if (prevBtn && thumbsEl) prevBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ thumbsEl.scrollBy({ left: -200, behavior: 'smooth' }); });
  if (nextBtn && thumbsEl) nextBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ thumbsEl.scrollBy({ left: 200, behavior: 'smooth' }); });

  var featData = [
    { name: 'Orthopaedic Foam Core', body: 'The Duo Sleep is built around a 25 cm orthopaedic foam core engineered for spine alignment and firm, even support across the entire sleeping surface — giving your back the reinforcement it needs, night after night.' },
    { name: 'Bamboo Knitted Cover', body: 'The Duo Sleep is wrapped in a premium bamboo knitted fabric that is naturally breathable and moisture-wicking. The cover actively regulates your sleeping temperature, drawing warmth and moisture away from the surface to keep you cool and comfortable.' },
    { name: 'Triple Comfort Foam Layers', body: 'Above the orthopaedic core, three layers of medium-firm foam work together to cushion pressure points at the shoulders, hips, and lower back — providing a plush, comfortable feel on the surface while the core delivers firm underlying support.' },
    { name: 'Pressure Relief', body: 'The layered foam construction of the Duo Sleep contours gently to your body shape, cushioning pressure points and distributing weight evenly across the sleeping surface — reducing the risk of waking up with stiffness or soreness.' },
    { name: 'Temperature Regulation', body: 'The bamboo knitted cover naturally regulates your sleeping temperature by wicking moisture and drawing warmth away from the body. This keeps you at the ideal sleep temperature throughout the night — comfortable in every season.' },
    { name: 'Couple-Friendly', body: 'The foam construction of the Duo Sleep absorbs and minimises partner movement, which means that shifting or getting up on one side of the mattress is less likely to disturb the other sleeper — making it an ideal choice for couples.' },
    { name: 'Medium-Firm Feel', body: 'The Duo Sleep delivers a medium-firm feel that is balanced and versatile — firm enough to keep your spine aligned, with enough surface give to cushion your pressure points. Suitable for back sleepers, side sleepers, and combination sleepers.' },
    { name: 'UK Quality', body: 'Every Klawford mattress is built to a high standard using quality materials — engineered for consistent comfort, durability, and long-lasting performance night after night.' }
  ];

  var titleEl = document.getElementById('klm-feat-title');
  var bodyEl  = document.getElementById('klm-feat-body');
  var pipEl   = document.getElementById('klm-feat-pip');

  function movePip(activeBtn) {
    if (!pipEl) return;
    var track = document.querySelector('.klm-features__track');
    if (!track) return;
    var trackRect = track.getBoundingClientRect();
    var btnRect   = activeBtn.getBoundingClientRect();
    var center    = btnRect.left + btnRect.width / 2 - trackRect.left;
    pipEl.style.left = center + 'px';
  }

  document.querySelectorAll('.klm-feat').forEach(function(btn, i){
    btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.querySelectorAll('.klm-feat').forEach(function(b){
        b.classList.remove('is-active');
        b.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'false');
      });
      btn.classList.add('is-active');
      btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', 'true');
      if (titleEl && featData[i]) titleEl.textContent = featData[i].name;
      if (bodyEl  && featData[i]) bodyEl.textContent  = featData[i].body;
      movePip(btn);
    });
  });

  var firstFeat = document.querySelector('.klm-feat.is-active');
  if (firstFeat) {
    setTimeout(function(){ movePip(firstFeat); }, 50);
  }
  window.addEventListener('resize', function(){
    var activeFeat = document.querySelector('.klm-feat.is-active');
    if (activeFeat) movePip(activeFeat);
  });

  document.querySelectorAll('.klm-faq__item').forEach(function(det){
    det.addEventListener('toggle', function(){
      if (det.open) {
        document.querySelectorAll('.klm-faq__item').forEach(function(d){
          if (d !== det) d.open = false;
        });
      }
    });
  });

})();
</script>

